; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   670      \DESCRIPTION    The API is called with an Id and a pointer.
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   671                      The API call is forwarded using a function pointer which is read using ComStackLib macros.
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   672                      
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   673      \COUNTERMEASURE \N The function pointer is read using the passed Id (and ComStackLib macros). 
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   674                         The Id is a SNV provided by the lower layer. 
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   675                         It is checked at runtime if it is in the valid range.
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   676                         The pointer is provided by the lower layer and is assumed to be valid. It is passed as is to the corresponding function. 
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   677  
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   678    \ID SBSW_PDUR_EXTERNAL_API_CALL_FORWARDING_ID_ONLY
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   679      \DESCRIPTION    The API is called with an Id.
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   680                      The API call is forwarded using a function pointer which is read using ComStackLib macros.
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   681                      
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   682      \COUNTERMEASURE \R The function pointer is read using the passed Id (and ComStackLib macros). 
; ..\Appl\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   683                         The Id is a SNV provided by the lower layer. 
